ccf2bf8 L2: an authoring turn is the record author's own authoring
 checks/library_graph_lint.clj                      | 74 ++++++++++++++++++----
 checks/spider_runner.clj                           |  2 +-
 library/aif/attestations-v3-reflection-audit.edn   | 10 ++-
 .../library-graph/reflection-v3-fixtures.edn       | 25 +++++++-
