holes/labs/library-contract/runs/build-loop.log:475:holes/labs/library-contract/runs/build-loop.log:8:**Changed (futon3 `a3bff43`, ledger `012dcf6`):** `library/.spider/attestation-schema.edn` gains `:warrant-refused {:by :at :note}`, which sits with `:state :proposed` — the directive line stays in the pattern file, unwarranted, while `:state :refused` keeps meaning the directive line leaves it. `checks/library_graph_lint.clj` validates the new key (`:169`), fails a record that carries it with any state but `:proposed` (`:195`, reason `:warrant-refusal-requires-proposed-state`), and counts `:edge-refusals` and `:warrant-refusals` apart in the summary. `:refused-edge-removed` is untouched, so only an edge-refusal still forces the line out. Two new deftests plant both acts on fixture records (`test/library_graph_lint_test.clj:159`, `:185`). `library/.spider/refusal-reclassification-2026-09-01.edn` reads the five prior `:refused` records: all five are edge-refusals by act — no directive naming the target survives in any of the five source patterns — and two (aif `:607`, `:646`) give a warrant-shaped ground, which I recorded rather than revised, since the act was the reviewer's.
holes/labs/library-contract/runs/build-loop.log:476:holes/labs/library-contract/runs/build-loop.log:12:**Reviewer should check:** that a warrant-refusal leaving the directive in place is the right call rather than a lint failure of its own; that recording the aif `:607`/`:646` grounds without re-deciding them is the right restraint; and the section-lint numbers — aif passes with `:edge-refusals 4`, while writing-coherence (4) and sidecar (2) fail on `:evidence-excerpt-mismatch` because the pinned fixture holds only aif's 56 evidence records. I measured those same counts against the pre-change linter via `git stash`, so they aren't a regression, but they mean those two sections have no green gate under the pin. Gates: clj-kondo exit 0 (0 errors, 0 warnings; the one `:info` at `library_graph_lint.clj:234` pre-dates this), check-parens exit 0, `library_graph_lint_test` 6 tests / 26 assertions / 0 failures, `spider_runner_test` 3 / 11 / 0 — exit codes captured to `/tmp/l1-*.rc`, not read through a pipe. `bb worklist_check.bb` exit 0 after the ledger commit.
